    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You pick up languages quickly and easily.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a number of additional <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Languages\" title=\"Languages\">Languages</a> equal to 1 + your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier (Minimum 1).</p><p><b>Special:</b> You can take this Feat more than once. Each time you take this Feat, you gain a number of additional languages equal to 1 + your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier (Minimum 1). If your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> modifier increases so does the number of languages granted by this Feat.</p>",
